      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HERES HERBIE NZ (10) comes off his first defeat in four WA starts but he drew on the back row and then worked when racing parked so it may pay to be forgiving. Had overcome a wide draw to win fresh prior and while he switches to a standing start and cops a 50m handicap he is a two-time third up winner so should be hitting his peak. FRANCO MOTU NZ (9) has been enjoying the standing starts, recording a win and a placing in his last two outings at this circuit and distance. Cops a tougher handicap this time but he is going well. STORMY VISTA NZ (8) raced parked and boxed on well as runner-up last well. Goes back 30m in the handicap but was a G1 Golden Nugget placegetter earlier this month so he is capable. LUVBITE (11) has been racing behind a mobile of late but has recorded four wins and three placings from his last seven standing start attempts so could be a big improver returning to those conditions.",
